<title>UK: NY State Dormitory Authority sets $774 mln bond.</title>
<headline>NY State Dormitory Authority sets $774 mln bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dormitory Authority of the State of New York has issued a multi-tranche bond for a total of $774.07 million, lead manager Lehman Brothers said.</p>
<p>The bonds will be priced later.</p>
<p>+ + +</p>
<p>    TRANCHE AMT ($MLN) MATURITY  SPREAD   FEES</p>
<p>    1	 33.875     01.OCT.97 +40 BP   25 BP</p>
<p>    2	 56.845     01.APR.98 +46	37.5</p>
<p>    3	 58.625     01.OCT.98 +48	37.5</p>
<p>    4	 60.510     01.APR.99 +50	37.5</p>
<p>    5	 62.500     01.OCT.99 +53	37.5</p>
<p>    6	 64.585     01.APR.00 +55	50</p>
<p>    7	 66.780     01.OCT.00 +58	50</p>
<p>    8	 69.065     01.APR.01 +60	50</p>
<p>    9	 71.470     01.OCT.01 +63	50</p>
<p>    10	73.960     01.APR.02 +65	50</p>
<p>    11	76.570     01.OCT.02 +68	50</p>
<p>    12	79.285     01.APR.03 +70	50</p>
<p>+ + +</p>
<p>Payment date is November 13.</p>
<p>The bonds will be listed in Luxembourg and sold in denominations of $5,000.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
</text>
